desktop priority SDK section {"active":"SDK Examples","text":"Interactive DemosPriority and Fairness\nFor the complete documentation index, see /llms.txt. This page is also available as raw Markdown at /demos/priority-fairness-walkthrough.md. Append .md to any page URL to fetch its Markdown.\nTask Queue Priority and Fairness - Interactive Walkthrough\nCopy for LLM\nView Markdown\nPriority & Fairness\nOverview\nTry It\nHow It Works\nSDK Examples\n\nSet a priority key, fairness key, or both when starting Workflows or scheduling Activities. Priority and Fairness are enabled by default - no configuration required for Temporal Cloud or self-hosted clusters running Temporal 1.26+.\n\nHow to use Priority\nView examples →\nHow to use Fairness\nView examples →\nTags:Task QueuesPriority and Fairness\n\nHelp us make Temporal better. View this page on GitHub.\n\nPrevious\nActivity retry simulator\nNext\nIntegrations"}
